# Image Module (Polymorphic)

Module image/ quan ly anh cho **moi entity** (User avatar, Store logo, Product gallery, Variant gallery, Review album) qua co che **polymorphic FK**.

## Schema (V3)

```text
images (
 id BIGSERIAL PK,
 owner_type VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL, -- enum: USER, STORE, PRODUCT, VARIANT, REVIEW
 owner_id BIGINT NOT NULL,
 public_id VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL, -- Cloudinary public_id
 secure_url TEXT NOT NULL,
 is_primary BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,
 display_order INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
 created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()
)

-- Index:
CREATE INDEX idx_images_owner ON images(owner_type, owner_id);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uq_images_one_primary_per_owner
 ON images(owner_type, owner_id) WHERE is_primary = true;
```

## Invariants

- Mot owner chi co **dung 1** anh is_primary = true (partial unique index).
- display_order >= 0.
- Xoa owner (User/Store/Product/Variant/Review) phai cascade xoa anh lien quan (xu ly qua image/listener + image/event).
- Khi xoa 1 anh primary, tu dong set anh co display_order nho nhat con lai lam primary.

## Ownership rule

- Moi thao tac GET / DELETE / PATCH (primary, order) tren image phai check:
  - resolveImageOwner(image) == currentPrincipal
- Neu khong khop -> IMAGE_OWNER_FORBIDDEN (HTTP 403).
- Admin co the force-delete (forceDeleteImage) cho moderation.

## Cloudinary

- Config qua application.yaml:
  ```yaml
  cloudinary:
    cloud-name: ${CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME:}
    api-key: ${CLOUDINARY_API_KEY:}
    api-secret: ${CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET:}
    folder: ${CLOUDINARY_FOLDER:flash-sale-b2c/local}
  ```
- Folder mac dinh: flash-sale-b2c/{profile}.
- Multipart limit: max-file-size: 10MB, max-request-size: 50MB.

## Migration legacy

- V4 da drop 5 cot anh cu: users.avatar_url, stores.logo_url, products.image_url, product_variants.image_url, product_reviews.image_urls.
- KHONG them lai cac cot nay - luon dung bang images.

## Endpoint (da co)

- POST /api/v1/images?ownerType=...&ownerId=... - Upload.
- GET /api/v1/images?ownerType=...&ownerId=... - List anh.
- PATCH /api/v1/images/{id}/primary - Set primary (owner only).
- PATCH /api/v1/images/{id}/order - Set display_order (owner only).
- DELETE /api/v1/images/{id} - Xoa anh (ca Cloudinary).
- DELETE /api/v1/admin/images/{id} - Force delete (Admin).

